.* CFG: the task menu for configuration.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CFG'.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CFG HELP=HLPCFG KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Configuration
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI HELP='CFG/OPT1' OPTION=1 ACTION='MENU CFGDEVCMN'.Configure devices and communications
:MENUI HELP='CFG/OPT2' OPTION=2 ACTION='MENU NETCFG'.Network configuration
:MENUI HELP='CFG/OPT3' OPTION=3 ACTION='MENU HARDWARE'.Hardware resources
:MENUI HELP='CFG/OPT4' OPTION=4 ACTION='MENU NETWORK'.Network management
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCFG.Configuration - Help
:P.Descriptions of the devices, lines and network the system uses, and the
hardware they run on.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFG/OPT1'.Configure devices and communications
:P.Option 1. Shows menu CFGDEVCMN&colon. Configure devices and
communications.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFG/OPT2'.Network configuration
:P.Option 2. Shows menu NETCFG&colon. Network configuration.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFG/OPT3'.Hardware resources
:P.Option 3. Shows menu HARDWARE&colon. Hardware resources.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFG/OPT4'.Network management
:P.Option 4. Shows menu NETWORK&colon. Network management.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
